DESCRIPTION:Hailing from Portugal and now based in Los Angeles\, Nacya Marr
 eiro\nis a multilingual stand-up comedian and actress with a bold\,\nintern
 ational voice. Fluent in Portuguese\, Spanish\, English\, and basic\nFrench
 \, she brings sharp cultural insight and fearless honesty to both\nstage an
 d screen.\n\nNacya is the creator of The Riff \, an improv stand-up show se
 lected for the New York Comedy Festival 2024 . Her acclaimed one-woman show
