  Triad Theater \, while her stand-up hour “Pretty Privilege” runs month
 ly at The Comedy Store . Trained by renowned acting coach Julie Areola \, N
 acya’s acting credits include Adrianna in the BET film Hands \, Gigi in T
 he Contract (BET) \, Valentine in Moving Valentine (Amazon Prime) \, and Ri
